"<header class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"container in\">\n    <div class=\"mark\"><img src=\"/architecture-pitch/image-0.png\" alt=\"NocoBase\" width=\"145\" height=\"24\"></div>\n    <ol aria-label=\"Sections\">\n      <li><a href=\"#s1\" data-step=\"s1\">NocoBase 2 No-code</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#s2\" data-step=\"s2\">NocoBase 2 AI Portal</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#s3\" data-step=\"s3\">NocoBase 3</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#s5\" data-step=\"s5\">Why NocoBase</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#s4\" data-step=\"s4\">Comparison</a></li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n</header><main class=\"container\">\n\n  <section class=\"hero\">\n    <h1>NocoBase 2 No-code, NocoBase 2 AI Portal, and NocoBase 3</h1>\n    <p>These three approaches differ in where business logic lives: configuration in a database, or source code in your own repository.</p>\n    <ul class=\"legend\" aria-label=\"Legend\">\n      <li><i class=\"sw nb\"></i>Provided by NocoBase</li>\n      <li><i class=\"sw src\"></i>Your source code</li>\n      <li><i class=\"sw cfg\"></i>Database configuration</li>\n      <li><i class=\"sw zone\"></i>Runtime boundary</li>\n      <li><i class=\"sw new\"></i>New in this step</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 01 -->\n  <section class=\"sec\" id=\"s1\">\n    <p class=\"label\">01</p>\n    <h2>NocoBase 2 No-code <span class=\"m\">· Runtime plus configuration</span></h2>\n    <p class=\"lead\">Tables, pages, permissions, and workflows live in the database. The platform reads configuration to render the interface. AI also works by calling APIs to write configuration.</p>\n    <div class=\"sec-body\">\n      <div class=\"canvas\"><svg id=\"d1\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"NocoBase 2 no-code architecture\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 594\"><defs><marker id=\"d1-a\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"#7a8291\"></path></marker></defs><rect x=\"20\" y=\"50\" width=\"160\" height=\"60\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#6b7383\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"74\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5d6575\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></circle><path d=\"M30,92 q10,-14 20,0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5d6575\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"58\" y=\"77\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1f2433\" textLength=\"14\" lengthAdjust=\"spacingAndGlyphs\">User</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5d6575\" textLength=\"60\" lengthAdjust=\"spacingAndGlyphs\">Configure in UI</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"210\" width=\"160\" height=\"60\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#6b7383\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"234\" r=\"5.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5d6575\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></circle><path d=\"M30,252 q10,-14 20,0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#5d6575\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"58\" y=\"237\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1f2433\">AI Agent</text><text x=\"58\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#5d6575\" textLength=\"107\" lengthAdjust=\"spacingAndGlyphs\">Configure via nb api</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"20\" width=\"740\" height=\"110\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fbfcfd\" stroke=\"#c9d0da\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></rect><text x=\"254\" y=\"41\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#3f4757\" textLength=\"39\" lengthAdjust=\"spacingAndGlyphs\">Browser</text><rect x=\"260\" y=\"56\" width=\"700\" height=\"54\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#eef2fd\" stroke=\"#6f88e3\" stroke-width=\"1\"></rect><text x=\"272\" y=\"80\" font-size=\"13.5\" font-weight=\"600\" fill=\"#1f2a5c\" textLength=\"110\" lengthAdjust=\"spacingAndGlyphs\">Platform renderer</text><text x=\"272\" y=\"98\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#4d5884\" textLength=\"204\" lengthAdjust=\"spacingAndGlyphs\">Client V1 / V2: render configuration</text><g><rect x=\"240\" y=\"166\" width=\"740\" height=\"264\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fbfcfd\" stroke=\"#c9d0da\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 4\"></rect><t